        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.ActionNode",
        "$id": "63"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "Excellent, thank you. The sharing of information is essential for merchants like us. You’ll get your reward once you’ve delivered the ledger.",
          "_meta": "Merchant_Cierzo_GeneralStore_05"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_merchant_cierzogeneralstore_01",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 6210.0,
          "y": 6840.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "68"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "Need something else?",
          "_meta": "Merchant_Monsoon_Blacksmith_02"
        },
        "_actorName": "General Store",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 6270.0,
          "y": 6975.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "70"
      },
      {
        "_targetNode": {
          "$ref": "4"
        },
        "_position": {
          "x": 6300.0,
          "y": 7095.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.GoToNode",
        "$id": "72"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "Need something else?",
          "_meta": "Merchant_Monsoon_Blacksmith_02"
        },
        "_actorName": "General Store",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 6690.0,
          "y": 6360.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "73"
      },
      {
        "_targetNode": {
          "$ref": "4"
        },
        "_position": {
          "x": 6720.0,
          "y": 6525.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.GoToNode",
        "$id": "75"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "Farewell.",
          "_meta": "Merchant_Generic_Farewell_01"
        },
        "_actorName": "General Store",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 6285.0,
          "y": 5685.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "76"
      },
      {
        "_position": {
          "x": 6345.0,
          "y": 5790.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.FinishNode",
        "$id": "78"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "Sure, what do you want to know?",
          "_meta": "crafting_tutorial_01"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_merchant_berggeneralstore_01 ",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 6855.0,
          "y": 5670.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "79"
      },
      {
        "availableChoices": [
          {
            "statement": {
              "_text": "Can you teach me about survival crafting?",
              "_meta": "Player_craft_tutorial_a_01"
            }
          },
          {
            "statement": {
              "_text": "How useful is it to have a backpack?",
              "_meta": "Player_craft_tutorial_a_02"
            }
          },
          {
            "statement": {
              "_text": "What’s a good way to handle my inventory?",
              "_meta": "Player_craft_tutorial_a_03"
            }
          }
        ],
        "_position": {
          "x": 7020.0,
          "y": 5820.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.MultipleChoiceNodeExt",
        "$id": "81"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "Whenever you need to, you can craft a great variety of items to aid in your survival. For example, some wood and a linen scrap can be made into a torch if you need light.",
          "_meta": "crafting_tutorial_02"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_merchant_berggeneralstore_01 ",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 6825.0,
          "y": 6030.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "89"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "Not only can you assemble things like tents, backpacks and weapons out of raw materials, you can also disassemble many items like clothes, or weapons to get raw materials to make new items. ",
          "_meta": "crafting_tutorial_03"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_merchant_berggeneralstore_01 ",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 6810.0,
          "y": 6120.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "91"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "Using what your environment provides you, either through experimentation or learning crafting recipes, is the difference between a lost wanderer and an expert explorer. ",
          "_meta": "crafting_tutorial_04"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_merchant_berggeneralstore_01 ",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 6825.0,
          "y": 6225.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "93"
      },
      {
        "_targetNode": {
          "$ref": "4"
        },
        "_position": {
          "x": 7440.0,
          "y": 6495.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.GoToNode",
        "$id": "95"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "The backpack is one of the most essential tools for any traveller. You’ll be able to carry more before you are over encumbered, and you can hang a lantern from most backpacks, freeing both your hands when exploring dark caves. ",
          "_meta": "crafting_tutorial_05"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_merchant_berggeneralstore_01 ",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 7230.0,
          "y": 6090.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "96"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "If you get into a fight, however, it's usually best to drop the bag ([backpack]). If you need to make a quick evasive dodge (tap [dodge]), a backpack will slow you down and make you an easier target.",
          "_meta": "crafting_tutorial_06"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_merchant_berggeneralstore_01 ",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 7260.0,
          "y": 6195.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "98"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "Oh, and a word of caution. Should your backpack be hit, it will damage the items inside. Pay attention to your equipment's durability, even when you're not actively using it. ",
          "_meta": "crafting_tutorial_07"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_merchant_berggeneralstore_01 ",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 7260.0,
          "y": 6300.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "100"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "Keep only what you can't live without in your pockets, and store your camp gear and loot in your backpack. This will keep you light on your feet and more effective in a fight.",
          "_meta": "crafting_tutorial_08"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_merchant_berggeneralstore_01 ",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 7605.0,
          "y": 6000.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "102"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "Learning how to effectively split your gear between backpack and pockets is essential. You don't want to find yourself without bandages at a bad time, and you don't want to be overburdened either. ",
          "_meta": "crafting_tutorial_09"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_merchant_berggeneralstore_01 ",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 7665.0,
          "y": 6105.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "104"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "While wearing a backpack, anything you pick up will go straight to the bag. Consider setting items you use often, like bandages, to shortcuts (Quickslots) so you'll have them ready whenever you need them.",
          "_meta": "crafting_tutorial_10"
        },
        "_actorName": "name_merchant_berggeneralstore_01 ",
        "_actorParameterID": "c5474f61-b6dd-4fba-b619-f779585e03c2",
        "_position": {
          "x": 7740.0,
          "y": 6210.0
        },
        "$type": "NodeCanvas.DialogueTrees.StatementNodeExt",
        "$id": "106"
